Package: EPIC2
Type: Package
Title: LD-Aware Integration of Single-Cell Chromatin Accessibility and GWAS
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lingxuan", "Zhu", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "zhulx@tamu.edu",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-0502-4911")),
    person("Yuchao", "Jiang", role = c("aut", "ths"),
           email = "yuchaojiang@tamu.edu")
  )
Description: A configurable workflow for harmonizing genome-wide association
    study summary statistics with single-cell or single-nucleus ATAC-seq data.
    The package constructs SNP- and peak-level accessibility features, models
    local linkage disequilibrium at both resolutions, fits one-sided
    LD-adjusted association models, and combines component tests with the
    aggregated Cauchy association test.
